<title>UK: German inland gas oil falls, buyers stand aside.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil falls, buyers stand aside.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.6950)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     32.60/33.00     19.23/19.47   32.80/33.20</p>
<p> BREMEN		32.60/33.00     19.23/19.47   32.80/33.20</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    32.80/33.20     19.35/19.59   33.00/33.40</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   33.30/33.80     19.65/19.94   33.50/34.00</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   33.20/33.70     19.65/19.94   33.40/33.80</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  34.00/34.40     20.06/20.29   34.20/34.60</p>
<p>German inland gas oil fell again on Monday after heavy price losses last week. Traders said a combination of mild weather prompting poor physical demand and $2.25 losses on futures exerted bearish pressure. -- +44 171 542 8980</p>
